    },
    {
      "text": "A somewhat different Poké Ball that works\nespecially well when catching Pokémon that\nlive underwater.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "水の　世界で　暮らしている\nポケモンが　捕まえやすくなる\nちょっと　変わった　ボール。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "有点与众不同的球。\n能很容易地捕捉\n生活在水世界里的宝可梦。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Es algo distinta a las demás. Funciona especialmente\nbien con los Pokémon que viven bajo el agua.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
